{"dependencies":["List.nil","String","String.ofByteArray","ByteArray","String.push._proof_5","ByteArray.append","List.utf8Encode","ByteArray.IsValidUTF8","String.push.match_1","Char","List.cons"],"doc":"Adds a character to the end of a string.\n\nThe internal implementation uses dynamic arrays and will perform destructive updates\nif the string is not shared.\n\nExamples:\n* `\"abc\".push 'd' = \"abcd\"`\n* `\"\".push 'a' = \"a\"`\n","extra":null,"kind":"definition","levels":[],"module":"Init.Data.String.Bootstrap","name":"String.push","nodes":[["constant","String",[]],["constant","Char",[]],["forall","a._@._internal._hyg.0",1,0,"explicit"],["forall","a._@._internal._hyg.0",0,2,"explicit"],["constant","String.push.match_1",[["succ",["zero"]]]],["lambda","x._@.Init.Data.String.Bootstrap.1061955010._hygCtx.8.Init.Data.String.Bootstrap.1061955010._hygCtx._hyg.29",1,0,"explicit"],["lambda","x._@.Init.Data.String.Bootstrap.1061955010._hygCtx.7.Init.Data.String.Bootstrap.1061955010._hygCtx._hyg.26",0,5,"explicit"],["apply",4,6],["bound",1],["apply",7,8],["bound",0],["apply",9,10],["constant","ByteArray",[]],["constant","ByteArray.IsValidUTF8",[]],["apply",13,10],["constant","String.ofByteArray",[]],["constant","ByteArray.append",[]],["bound",2],["apply",16,17],["constant","List.utf8Encode",[]],["constant","List.cons",[["zero"]]],["apply",20,1],["apply",21,10],["constant","List.nil",[["zero"]]],["apply",23,1],["apply",22,24],["apply",19,25],["apply",18,26],["apply",15,27],["constant","String.push._proof_5",[]],["apply",29,17],["apply",30,8],["apply",31,10],["apply",28,32],["lambda","c",1,33,"explicit"],["lambda","h",14,34,"explicit"],["lambda","b",12,35,"explicit"],["apply",11,36],["lambda","x._@.Init.Data.String.Bootstrap.1061955010._hygCtx._hyg.8",1,37,"explicit"],["lambda","x._@.Init.Data.String.Bootstrap.1061955010._hygCtx._hyg.7",0,38,"explicit"]],"project":false,"range":{"column":0,"endColumn":79,"endLine":41,"line":25},"type":3,"typeText":"String → Char → String","unsafe":false,"value":39,"source":{"code":"/--\nAdds a character to the end of a string.\n\nThe internal implementation uses dynamic arrays and will perform destructive updates\nif the string is not shared.\n\nExamples:\n* `\"abc\".push 'd' = \"abcd\"`\n* `\"\".push 'a' = \"a\"`\n-/\n@[extern \"lean_string_push\", expose]\ndef push : String → Char → String\n  | ⟨b, h⟩, c => ⟨b.append (List.utf8Encode [c]), ?pf⟩\nwhere finally\n  have ⟨m, hm⟩ := h\n  cases hm\n  exact .intro (m ++ [c]) (by simp [List.utf8Encode, List.toByteArray_append'])","start":25,"end":41},"axioms":["propext"]}